==> 3. POST /exams/dso303-midterm/attempts  (start the timer)
{"attemptId":"268e993b-714b-4a23-9986-1cc78349f5d7","endsAt":"2026-11-15T10:32:16Z","autosaveSeconds":30}

==> 4. Autosave every 30 s: PUT /attempts/268e993b-714b-4a23-9986-1cc78349f5d7/answers  (-> DynamoDB, conditional write)
{"attemptId":"268e993b-714b-4a23-9986-1cc78349f5d7","saved":2,"stale":0,"savedAt":"2026-11-15T09:32:16.968Z"}   <- t=0s
{"attemptId":"268e993b-714b-4a23-9986-1cc78349f5d7","saved":3,"stale":0,"savedAt":"2026-11-15T09:32:17.043Z"}   <- t=30s
Late retry of the t=0s request (must NOT overwrite the newer q2 answer):
{"attemptId":"268e993b-714b-4a23-9986-1cc78349f5d7","saved":0,"stale":1,"savedAt":"2026-11-15T09:32:17.091Z"}

